ted file(s) - Clear selection X Select all'. A table lists available datasets for download. The columns are 'File', 'Area of interest', 'Version', 'Resolution', 'Type', and 'Format'. The visible table rows include: * A checked checkbox for 'IMD_2018_010m_al_03035_v020', corresponding to 'Albania', version 'v020', '10 m' resolution, 'Raster' type, and 'Geotiff' format. * An unchecked checkbox for 'IMD_2018_010m_at_03035_v020', corresponding to 'Austria', version 'v020', '10 m' resolution, 'Raster' type, and 'Geotiff' format. * An unchecked checkbox for 'IMD_2018_010m_ba_03035_v020', corresponding to 'Bosnia and Herzegovina', version 'v020', '10 m' resolution, 'Raster' type, and 'Geotiff' format. * An unchecked checkbox for 'IMD_2018_010m_be_03035_v020', corresponding to 'Belgium', version 'v020', '10 m' resolution, 'Raster' type, and 'Geotiff' format. This screenshot illustrates the user interface for browsing and selecting High Resolution Layer Imperviousness Density (HRL IMD) data for download, available as pre-packaged datasets for individual countries or regions.)
