  /Alt (This table presents a segment of the Land Use Attribute (LUA) classification scheme, specifically detailing 'Cultural, Entertainment and Recreational Services' and 'Transport Networks, Logistics, Utilities'. The table includes metadata for the entire dataset: 'Class Code' is 41, 'Name' is 'Sports area', '100% EAGLE Compliant' is 'Yes', and 'Colour Code' is '#000000'. The main table columns are: / URI / Code / Label / Level / Barcode / Factor / /:----------------------------/:-------------/:--------------------------------------------------/:------/:--------/:-------/ / https://dd.LUA-3_3_4_2 / LUA-3_3_4_2 / Monastery / 4 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_3_4_3 / LUA-3_3_4_3 / Cemetery / 4 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_3_5 / LUA-3_3_5 / Other Community Services / 3 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_4 / LUA-3_4 / Cultural, Entertainment and Recreational Services / 2 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_4_1 / LUA-3_4_1 / Cultural Services / 3 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_4_1_1 / LUA-3_4_1_1 / Indoor Cultural Service / 4 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_4_1_2 / LUA-3_4_1_2 / Outdoor Cultural Service / 4 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_4_2 / LUA-3_4_2 / Entertainment / 3 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_4_3 / LUA-3_4_3 / Sports Infrastructure / 3 / 5 / / / https://dd.LUA-3_4_3_1 / LUA-3_4_3_1 / Golf Course / 4 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_4_3_2 / LUA-3_4_3_2 / Ski Piste / 4 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_4_3_3 / LUA-3_4_3_3 / Outdoor Racecourse / 4 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_4_3_4 / LUA-3_4_3_4 / Sport Hall / 4 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_4_3_5 / LUA-3_4_3_5 / Stadium / 4 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_4_3_6 / LUA-3_4_3_6 / Swimming Pool / 4 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_4_3_7 / LUA-3_4_3_7 / Sports Ground / 4 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_4_3_8 / LUA-3_4_3_8 / Indoor Sport-/Fitness Facility / 4 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_4_3_9 / LUA-3_4_3_9 / Yachtharbour, Sport Boat Marina / 4 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_4_4 / LUA-3_4_4 / Open Air Recreational Areas / 3 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_4_4_1 / LUA-3_4_4_1 / Urban Greenery and City Parks / 4 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_4_4_2 / LUA-3_4_4_2 / (Semi-)Natural Areas Used for Recreation / 4 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_4_5 / LUA-3_4_5 / Other Recreational Services / 3 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_4_5_1 / LUA-3_4_5_1 / Allotment Garden / 4 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_4_5_2 / LUA-3_4_5_2 / Amateur Fishing / 4 / / / / https://dd.LUA-3_5 / LUA-3_5 / Other Services / 2 / / / / https://dd.LUA-4 / LUA-4 / Transport Networks, Logistics, Utilities / 1 / / / The 'Level' column indicates the hierarchical depth of each Land Use Attribute (LUA) category. The 'Barcode' column contains a value of '5' for the 'Sports Infrastructure' (LUA-3_4_3) entry, suggesting a specific classification code for this category within a wider 'Sports area' context. The table details various sub-categories under 'Sports Infrastructure,' all at Level 4, such as 'Golf Course,' 'Ski Piste,' 'Stadium,' and 'Swimming Pool.')
