<<
  /Type /StructElem
  /S /Figure
  /P 3138 0 R
  /Alt (A screenshot of the CLC+ Core User Admin/Support interface, displaying a 'Data Catalogue' view on the left and a 'Notifications' panel on the right. The top header bar features navigation links: 'Data Catalogue', 'EAGLE Ontology', 'About EAGLE', 'Organisations', and 'Users'. On the far right, it shows a bell icon with a blue dot \(indicating new notifications\), a user profile icon, and the text 'CLC+ Core User Admin/Support'. The 'Data Catalogue' section includes filtering and search options: a 'Filter' button, checkboxes for 'My organisation/s', 'My data', 'Ingestions', and 'Extractions', and a 'Search' input field. Action buttons are prominent: 'ADD INGESTION', 'ADD EXTRACTION', and an icon for export or download. Below these controls is a table listing data entries with the following columns: 'EAGLE Approved' \(checkboxes are checked for all visible entries\), 'Name', 'Type' \(represented by a folder icon\), 'Created At', 'Created By', 'Country', 'Region', 'Reference Year', 'Time Range', 'Organisation/s', 'Contact Person', and 'Status' \(with a downward arrow for sorting\). Three table rows are visible: 1. **Name:** 'CLC+Backbone \(2018\)', **Created At:** '05.09.2023', **Created By:** 'CLC+ Core User Admi...', **Country:** 'European Environ...', **Region:** '-', **Reference Year:** '2018', **Time Range:** '01.07.2017 - 30.06.2019', **Organisation/s:** 'CLC, European En...', **Contact Person:** 'copernicus@eea....', **Status:** 'USED' \(with a green checkmark icon\). 2. **Name:** 'Coastal Zones \(CZ\) 20...', **Created At:** '21.06.2023', **Created By:** 'CLC+ Core User Admi...', **Country:** 'European Environ...', **Region:** 'European Environ...', **Reference Year:** '2018', **Time Range:** '01.01.2017 - 31.12.2019', **Organisation/s:** 'CLC, European En...', **Contact Person:** 'info@eea.europa...', **Status:** 'USED' \(with a green checkmark icon\). 3. **Name:** 'Corine Land Cover \(CL...', **Created At:** '06.09.2023', **Created By:** 'CLC+ Core User Admi...', **Country:** 'European Environ...', **Region:** '-', **Reference Year:** '2018', **Time Range:** '01.01.2017 - 31.12.2018', **Organisation/s:** 'CLC, European En...', **Contact Person:** 'copernicus@eea....', **Status:** 'USED' \(with a red exclamation mark icon\). The right-hand panel, labeled 'Notifications', can be closed with an 'x' icon. It contains a 'MARK ALL AS READ' option with a green checkmark icon. The visible notifications are: * 'Urban Atlas \(UA\) 2012 published.' \(indicated by a blue dot\), received 'Just now'. * 'UA_IBK_2018 processing finished.' \(indicated by a green checkmark icon\), received '3 hours ago'. * 'UA_IBK_2018 processing cancelled.' \(indicated by a red exclamation mark icon\), received '4 hours ago'.)
